        <summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;As promised in the &lt;a rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;blog.galactic-forensics.space&#x2F;blog&#x2F;09-instrumentrs2-lakeshore336&#x2F;&quot;&gt;last blog post&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;,
